From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 11:52:08 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] wrench: SWGL_GPU_NATIVE=1 renders through compositor tiles on
 the GPU

A native compositor whose tiles are Direct3D textures that SWGL draws into,
as Gecko's D3D11 SWGL compositor does on the phone; the tiles are read
back and composited on the CPU so the result compares with a CPU render.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
